{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54399","headline":"题玉泉 · 黄璞","name":"题玉泉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"水性能方圆，泉色常珪壁。\n云山静有辉。\n琼液来无迹。\n泉上修禅人，曹溪分一滴。\n监止更澄源，纷纷万缘息。\n（见《嘉定赤城志》卷二十三）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄璞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54399.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54399","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}